# Flourishing Bloom-Kin turned face up with a single Forest card in the library (the Mountain is not one): Bot1 finds it, and it
# goes onto the battlefield (tapped, the ruling: "put one onto the battlefield tapped" comes first) and nothing goes into the hand,
# so Bot1 is not asked which of two goes where (`! Bot1.Choose`). The library is shuffled anyway. Bloom-Kin is then 2/2 with two
# Forests, the one played and the one found. Black Lotus pays the face-down cast; Forest and four Moxen pay the {4}{G}.

